#: ../../site/contributing.md:1
msgid "Contributing to code and documentation"
msgstr "参与代码与文档贡献"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:3
msgid "Code changes"
msgstr "代码变更"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:5
msgid ""
"Build and run the full C++ suite, then add targeted tests for new behavior. "
"Keep public signatures and contracts explicit; update the English API "
"comment, the Chinese translation and the public symbol ledger in the same "
"change."
msgstr ""
"构建并运行完整的 C++ 测试套件，然后为新行为补充有针对性的测试。保持公共签名和"
"契约明确；在同一次变更中更新英文 API 注释、中文译文和公共符号清单。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:9
msgid "Comment standard"
msgstr "注释规范"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:11
msgid ""
"Public declarations use `///` Google-style contracts: a verb phrase such as "
"“Returns …”, units, alignment/missing-value rules, ownership, and verified "
"failure modes. Implementation comments explain non-obvious algorithms and "
"invariants, not line-by-line mechanics. Do not invent complexity, thread "
"safety or exception guarantees."
msgstr ""
"公共声明使用 `///` 风格的 Google 契约注释：以“Returns …”这类动词短语开头，并"
"说明单位、对齐/缺失值规则、所有权以及经验证的失败模式。实现注释用于解释不显而"
"易见的算法和不变量，而不是逐行说明实现机制。不要臆造复杂度、线程安全或异常保"
"证。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:17
msgid "Documentation changes"
msgstr "文档变更"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:19
msgid ""
"The English source is authoritative. Generate gettext catalogs, update "
"Chinese translations, and build both languages with strict warnings. The "
"docs source is under `docs/site`; generated HTML/XML and `.mo` files stay "
"out of Git."
msgstr ""
"英文源文件是权威版本。生成 gettext 消息目录、更新中文译文，并在严格警告模式下"
"构建两种语言。文档源位于 `docs/site` 下；生成的 HTML/XML 和 `.mo` 文件不纳入 "
"Git。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:23
msgid ""
"cd docs/site\n"
"doxygen Doxyfile\n"
"sphinx-build -b gettext -W --keep-going . ../_build/gettext\n"
"sphinx-intl update -p ../_build/gettext -l zh_CN\n"
"sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . ../_build/html/en\n"
"FINCORE_DOCS_LANGUAGE=zh_CN sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . ../"
"_build/html/zh_CN\n"
msgstr ""
"cd docs/site\n"
"doxygen Doxyfile\n"
"sphinx-build -b gettext -W --keep-going . ../_build/gettext\n"
"sphinx-intl update -p ../_build/gettext -l zh_CN\n"
"sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . ../_build/html/en\n"
"FINCORE_DOCS_LANGUAGE=zh_CN sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . ../"
"_build/html/zh_CN\n"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:32
msgid "Review and evidence"
msgstr "评审与证据"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:34
msgid ""
"Keep behavior changes, documentation-only changes and generated-artifact "
"updates in separate commits. Record the actual commit, checks and "
"exceptions; do not cite a local build as an online deployment."
msgstr ""
"将行为变更、仅文档变更和生成产物更新放在不同的提交中。记录实际提交、检查项和"
"例外情况；不要把本地构建说成在线部署。"
